From: crxssrazr93 <crxssrazr93@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 23:28:57 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] PortMaster port: keep Stage3D texture uploads on the
 GPU, texture dispose, AS3 profiler

BitmapData drawn on the GPU is copied straight into Stage3D textures after the
renderer submits its pending offscreen work, avoiding a GPU readback per upload.
TextureBase.dispose frees GPU memory. RUFFLE_AS3_PROF=1 logs the hottest AS3 methods.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Kmv4BB92SbyvEePk3QGe8q
